{
  "name": "Transcribe and add subtitles to new Google Drive videos with Shotstack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b982e68e2c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "## Add subtitles to every video you drop in a Google Drive folder\n\nShotstack transcribes the speech itself and burns the subtitles into the video, so no separate transcription service is needed.\n\n### How it works\n- A new file in the watched Google Drive folder starts the workflow.\n- The file is shared by link so Shotstack can read it over the internet.\n- Shotstack transcribes the speech and renders a new MP4 with the subtitles burnt in.\n- The workflow waits for the render, then saves the captioned copy back to Drive.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Connect your Google Drive credentials and pick the folder to watch.\n- Connect your Shotstack credentials. A free API key is enough to start.\n- Pick a different Drive folder for the output, or the workflow will trigger on its own result and never stop.\n\n### Good to know\n- The video must contain speech. A silent clip fails the render.\n- Very large Drive files return a scan warning page instead of the video. Host those elsewhere.\n\n[How captions work](https://shotstack.io/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=caption-drive-folder)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9833a8fd1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 670,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Watch Drive and send the video\nEach new file is shared by link, then handed to Shotstack to transcribe and caption."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9838e9176",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        700,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 890,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Wait for the render\nShotstack answers with a render id and works in the background. This asks for the status every 10 seconds, moves on at `done`, and stops with Shotstack's reason at `failed`."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b983e2931b",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1680,
        -130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 450,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "## Save the captioned copy\nFetch the finished file, download it and put it back in Drive. Use a different folder from the one you watch."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b97f9e7dba",
      "name": "New video in the folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "event": "fileCreated",
        "options": {},
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "triggerOn": "specificFolder",
        "folderToWatch": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b97ff27f5f",
      "name": "Let Shotstack read the file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "share",
        "permissionsUi": {
          "permissionsValues": {
            "role": "reader",
            "type": "anyone"
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b980468104",
      "name": "Shotstack: burn in the captions",
      "type": "@shotstack/n8n-nodes-shotstack.shotstack",
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "edit": "={\n  \"timeline\": {\n    \"tracks\": [\n      {\n        \"clips\": [\n          {\n            \"asset\": {\n              \"type\": \"rich-caption\",\n              \"src\": \"alias://source\"\n            },\n            \"start\": 0,\n            \"length\": \"end\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"clips\": [\n          {\n            \"alias\": \"source\",\n            \"asset\": {\n              \"type\": \"video\",\n              \"src\": \"https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&confirm=t&id={{ $('New video in the folder').first().json.id }}\"\n            },\n            \"start\": 0,\n            \"length\": \"auto\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"output\": {\n    \"format\": \"mp4\",\n    \"resolution\": \"hd\"\n  }\n}",
        "resource": "render",
        "operation": "postRender"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9809a82a9",
      "name": "Wait 10 seconds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "unit": "seconds",
        "amount": 10
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b980ee844e",
      "name": "Check the render",
      "type": "@shotstack/n8n-nodes-shotstack.shotstack",
      "position": [
        980,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "render",
        "operation": "getRender"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9814285f3",
      "name": "Is it done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-it-done",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "done"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b981968798",
      "name": "Did it fail?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        1200,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "did-it-fail",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b981ea893d",
      "name": "Stop and say why",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        1420,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorType": "errorMessage",
        "errorMessage": "=Shotstack could not finish this render: {{ $json.error || $json.status }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b9823e8ae2",
      "name": "Download it",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        1740,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-9e37-79b982928c87",
      "name": "Save the captioned copy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "position": [
        1960,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $('New video in the folder').first().json.name }} (captioned)",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "options": {},
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "root"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Download it": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save the captioned copy",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is it done?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
